# Temporary bridge: keep the vendored, certified @atomicloud/diene.config tarball
# tracked (it re-includes past the bun-lib `*.tgz` ignore) so the branch installs
# reproducibly while config's real npm publish is blocked. See vendor/README.md.
!vendor/*.tgz
